@group B
@commands `/cdevtest tag item hearthandharvest:farmers_hats`
@pass Contains the H&H hat, Wardrobe hat, Vinery straw hat, Simple Hats farmerbrim; no `simplehats:summerhat`
@fails Tag script not applied
@from batches/r1112/rowtext.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest tag item hearthandharvest:farmers_hats
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tag done=1 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=hearthandharvest:farmers_hats n=\d+ ids=\S*hearthandharvest:farmers_hat\b
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=hearthandharvest:farmers_hats .*\bwardrobe:farmers_hat_helmet\b
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=hearthandharvest:farmers_hats .*\bvinery:straw_hat\b
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=hearthandharvest:farmers_hats .*\bsimplehats:farmerbrim\b
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=item tag=hearthandharvest:farmers_hats .*summerhat
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0

